* POS        90 12201    FORTRANS I/O FOR FAP PROGRAMS                  POS 0001
*      FAP                                                              NUPOS002
*NUPOS  N.Y.U. SUBROUTINE.  A FAP PROGRAM WHICH WHEN USED BY A FAP PROG.NUPOS003
*              THROUGH THE USE OF THE CALL PSEUDO-OP MAKES FORTRAN I/O  NUPOS004
*              SUBROUTINES AVAILABLE FOR BACKSPACE TAPE, REWIND TAPE,   NUPOS005
*              AND WRITE END OF FILE ON TAPE.  THE THREE ENTRIES ARE    NUPOS006
*      1. CALL NUBACK,T1,NLR1, T2, NLR2, ....., TN,NLRN     (BACKSPACE) NUPOS007
*      2. CALL NUREW,T1,T2,T3,T4,..............TN           (REWIND)    NUPOS008
*      3. CALL NUWEOF,T1,T2,T3,T4, ...........,TN           (WRITE EOF) NUPOS009
*      WHERE    T   ARE THE TAPE NUMBERS SUCH AS 2,8,6,4,ETC.           NUPOS010
*               NLR  ARE THE NUMBERS OF LOGICAL RECORDS TO BACKSPACE.   NUPOS011
*      SPECIAL NOTE... THIS ROUTINE (WITH THE SAME ENTRY POINT NAMES) ISNUPOS012
*              ALREADY A PART OF NUSNUP, A LARGER SUB-ROUINE WHICH      NUPOS013
*              PROVIDES ENTRIES TO PERFORM ALL FORTRAN I/O OPERATIONS.  NUPOS014
       COUNT   70                                                       NUPOS015
       ENTRY   NUBACK                                                   NUPOS016
       ENTRY   NUREW                                  (REWIND TAPE)     NUPOS017
       ENTRY   NUWEOF                            (WRITE END OF FILE)    NUPOS018
*      ***    IF STANDARD ERROR PROCEDURE NOT IN SYSTEM MAKE THIS A PZE NUPOS019
*      ***   AND MAKE THIS  A    BCI  1,NUPOS                           NUPOS020
NUBACK CAL     ATBST          A TSX (BST),4                             NUPOS021
       SLW     TOCALL                                                   NUPOS022
       CAL     ANOP          NOP                                        NUPOS023
       SLW     AGAIN                                                    NUPOS024
       CAL     ATXI2         TXI  TNARG,2,-2                            NUPOS025
       SLW     NDLOOP                                                   NUPOS026
       TRA     SAVER                                                    NUPOS027
NUWEOF CAL     ATEFT          A TSX (EFT),4                             NUPOS028
       SLW     TOCALL                                                   NUPOS029
       TRA     *+3                                                      NUPOS030
 NUREW CAL     ATRWT          A TSX (RWT),4                             NUPOS031
       SLW     TOCALL                                                   NUPOS032
       CAL     ATXI1         TXI  TNARG,2,-1                            NUPOS033
       SLW     NDLOOP                                                   NUPOS034
       CAL     ATRA          TRA STRAT                                  NUPOS035
       SLW     AGAIN                                                    NUPOS036
 SAVER SXA     SAV2,2                                                   NUPOS037
       SXA     SAV1,1                                                   NUPOS038
       AXT     0,1        START INDEX ONE WITH A ZERO                   NUPOS039
       SXD     NUBACK-2,4                                               NUPOS040
       LXD     NUBACK-2,2                                               NUPOS041
 TNARG CAL     1,2           TAPE NUMBER                                NUPOS042
       ARS     15                                                       NUPOS043
       LAS     ATSXZ         IS NEXT ARG. A TSX WITH A T AG OF ZERO     NUPOS044
       TRA     RESTOR        NO                                         NUPOS045
       TRA     *+2                                                      NUPOS046
       TRA     RESTOR        NO                                         NUPOS047
 AGAIN NOP                   IS A NOP FOR BST/ A TRA  START FOR E FT,RWTNUPOS048
       CAL     2,2           IF BST THIS IS THE NUMBER OF RE  CORDS BKSPNUPOS049
       ARS     15                                                       NUPOS050
       LAS     ATSXZ                                                    NUPOS051
       TRA     RESTOW        IF LAST ARG NOT GIVEN SUPPL Y A ONE        NUPOS052
       TRA     *+2           GIVEN                                      NUPOS053
       TRA     RESTOW        SEE ABOVE                                  NUPOS054
       CAL     2,2           NUMBER OF RECOR DS TO BACKSPACE            NUPOS055
       PAX     0,1                                                      NUPOS056
 START CLA     1,2           TAPE NUMBER                                NUPOS057
       ALS     18                                                       NUPOS058
       STO     TAPNU                                                    NUPOS059
LOCTNU CAL     TAPNU                                                    NUPOS060
TOCALL TSX     **,4          A TSX BST,4 OR EFT,4 OR RWT,4              NUPOS061
       TIX     LOCTNU,1,1   X1=0 FOR EFT,RWT..=SOME NUMB. FOR BST       NUPOS062
NDLOOP TXI     0        A TXI TNARG,2,-2 FOR BST/ 2,-1 FOR EFT AND BST  NUPOS063
RESTOW CLA     1,2      TAPE NUMBER FOR BACK ROUTINE                    NUPOS064
       TXI     *+1,2,1    FIX INDEX 2 FOR PROPER RETURN TO MAIN PROG.   NUPOS065
       AXT     0,1     MAKE LAST ARG. FOR BACK = TO A ONE               NUPOS066
       TRA     START+1          LAST BACKSPACE TO PERFORM               NUPOS067
       REM                                                              NUPOS068
RESTOR PXA     0,2                                                      NUPOS069
 SAV2  AXT     **,2                                                     NUPOS070
 SAV1  AXT     **,1                                                     NUPOS071
       PAX     0,4                                                      NUPOS072
       TRA     1,4                                                      NUPOS073
 ATBST TSX     $(BST),4                                                 NUPOS074
 ANOP  NOP                                                              NUPOS075
 ATXI2 TXI     TNARG,2,-2                                               NUPOS076
ATEFT  TSX     $(EFT),4                                                 NUPOS077
ATRWT  TSX     $(RWT),4                                                 NUPOS078
ATXI1  TXI     TNARG,2,-1                                               NUPOS079
 ATRA  TRA     START                                                    NUPOS080
 ATSXZ OCT     0074000                                                  NUPOS081
 TAPNU PZE                                                              NUPOS082
 AONE  PZE     1,0,0                                                    NUPOS083
       END                                                              NUPOS084
 THE FOLLOWING TWO CARDS SHOULD BE SUBSTITUTED IN THE DECK IF ASSEMBLY  NUPOS085
  IS MADE WITH A SYSTEM WHICH DOES NOT CONTAIN THE STANDARD ERROR PRO-  NUPOS086
 CEDURE.  THE PROGRAM STORES INDEX 4 IN THE PLACE OCCUPIED BY THE PZE.  NUPOS087
       PZE       TO BE USED IF STANDARD ERROR NOT IN SYSTEM.  NUPOS 019 NUPOS088
       BCI     1,NUPOS   USE IF STANDARD ERROR NOT IN SYSTEM   NUPOS020 NUPOS089
**************                        LST CARD NUPOS                    NUPOS090
